Z||000004||Master_Sushi||11-22-2001||09:09 PM||||Ya, its not oil from the filter I'm 100% sure its engine oil. I haven't oiled the K&N since I bought the car. I'm thinking maybe spray the filter with carb cleaner, then let it dry and put a little engine oil on it. I don't care if the filter dosen't work well, I change my oil ever 3k miles.||||reg||1
